partitionmanager (20.12.2-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * Add the configuration for the CI on salsa.
  * Drop the Debian man page, as it offers no useful information.
  * Use the kf5 dh addon, so standard bits for KF-based applications are used.
